    par Private payload delivery
        CoreA->>DXA: Send private batch [HTTP REST / JSON]
        DXA->>DXB: Transfer batch [HTTPS / mutual TLS]
        DXB-->>DXA: Transfer ACK [HTTPS / mutual TLS]
